# Use State from TypeScript

Add `trellis.state@v1` as a dependency and select only the actions the participant needs. Durable participant state is declared in IDL with its schema and optional state version.

```trellis
state preferences value {
  schema Preferences;
  state_version "preferences.v1";
}
```

Run `trellis update` and `trellis generate`, then import the generated state surface.
